S01 HTTP 200 https://man.openbsd.org/ssh_config
CLAIM Client config, first-value precedence, identity selection, Match exec, multiplexing
EXCERPT "Since the first obtained value for each directive is used, more host-specific declarations should be given near the beginning of the file" ; "ControlPersist ... master connection should remain open in the background"; Match exec listed among directives that run/accept commands ("The exec keyword executes the specified command under the user's shell")
